{"title":"The Book Of Lagier","synopsis":"Suatu hari seorang manusia berani memanggil Raja Iblis Itu adalah serakah dan gemuk\nPangeran Lagier Lou Jerlayla Rodwill\nNamun saat memanggil Raja Iblis dia melakukan kesalahan dalam prosesnya yang menyebabkan kematiannya\nTubuh Lagier dibekukan dengan paksa karena kontrak yang dia buat dengan Raja Iblis\nYah sebaiknya aku mengabulkan permintaannya saja\nRaja Iblis memutuskan untuk menjadi Lagier dan mengabulkan keinginan Pangeran sebelum dia dibekukan sampai mati\nSampai hari kerajaan Jerlayla menguasai dunia dengan kekuatan yang tak tertandingi oleh siapapun\nIni adalah awal dari legenda baru\nSaya harus mulai dengan menurunkan berat badan\nAku harus diet dulu","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"GongDeunTop","artist":"SIROO","genres":["Action","Adventure","Demon","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"2a9730f3-c5c1-4d50-a6e5-0174c0b9b163","number":"83","title":"Chapter 83","date":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"id":"bb52769a-8d6c-4853-a08b-b73b911a854f","number":"82","title":"Chapter 82","date":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"id":"6efdbabd-b8b7-427e-a866-cab9db6f182e","number":"81","title":"Chapter 81","date":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"id":"31267c5b-0657-43c8-90f4-6832cd168a02","number":"80","title":"Chapter 80","date":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"id":"b2a0947a-e095-4eb2-9aef-f23d1fa7b992","number":"79","title":"Chapter 79","date":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"id":"24c045b6-4b58-41fa-8074-be9e1fa7d9ec","number":"78","title":"Chapter 78","date":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"id":"0f10eb3d-1a88-4199-bff7-ee35f747c85e","number":"77","title":"Chapter 77","date":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"id":"839585e0-a071-4123-ac23-3b325af2759c","number":"76","title":"Chapter 76","date":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"id":"a1d61747-95d8-4ba1-934f-bdbf5890c7f6","number":"75","title":"Chapter 75","date":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"id":"e290a1c6-f832-4d25-9e63-4566db2f17af","number":"74","title":"Chapter 74","date":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"id":"646596b6-a2b1-